  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would fail to provide an acceptable quality of accommodation with regards to internal and external spaces for future occupiers, notably the bedroom within Flat A and the external amenity area for Flat B respectively.  It would be contrary to London Plan policy D6, the Nationally Described Space Standards and Local Plan Policy SC5 and SC6.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would fail to provide adequate cycle parking provisions for the development. It would be contrary to London Plan policies T5, and Local Plan policy EC2.",
    "Reason : 3 - In the absence of any submitted evidence, the proposal would fail to appropriately minimise carbon emissions and adequately address flood risk and surface water management. It would be contrary to London Plan policy SI 2 and Local Plan policy EQ1, EQ2 and EQ3.  "
  ],
